{"id":5457,"date":"2025-10-25T14:06:29","date_gmt":"2025-10-25T04:36:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?page_id=5457"},"modified":"2025-12-25T06:35:49","modified_gmt":"2025-12-24T21:05:49","slug":"google-shopping-free-listings","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/feedops\/google-shopping-free-listings\/","title":{"rendered":"Google Shopping Free Listings"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"5457\" class=\"elementor elementor-5457\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fde56a1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"fde56a1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35ac90c elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"35ac90c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"419\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Google-Shopping-Free-Listings-1-1024x536.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5459\" alt=\"Google Shopping Free Listings in the Google Shopping Tab\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Google-Shopping-Free-Listings-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Google-Shopping-Free-Listings-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Google-Shopping-Free-Listings-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Google-Shopping-Free-Listings-1.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ba3dc89 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ba3dc89\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d7729e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1d7729e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Google Shopping Free Listings: Start Selling for Free<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8f37aae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8f37aae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">\u00a0Most <strong>online retailers<\/strong> think Google Shopping is only for paid advertisers \u2014 but that\u2019s not actually true. You can now list your products on Google for free using the <strong>Google Shopping free listings program<\/strong>.<\/p><p>These listings appear in the <strong>Google Shopping tab<\/strong>, <strong>Google Search results<\/strong>, and even <strong>Google Maps<\/strong> \u2014 without paying for ads. Whether your <strong>online store<\/strong> runs on Shopify, WooCommerce, or Magento, these <strong>Google listings<\/strong> can bring you new traffic and sales from <strong>potential customers<\/strong> already searching for your <strong>popular products<\/strong>.<\/p><p>In this guide, you\u2019ll learn how <strong>Google Shopping works<\/strong>, how to set up your listings through <strong>Google Merchant Centre<\/strong>, and how to optimize your <strong>product information<\/strong> for better visibility. You\u2019ll also discover how to track results in <strong>Organic Google Shopping<\/strong> within Analytics and use this free exposure to grow your <strong>sales channels<\/strong>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f36d0e e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6f36d0e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f677b17 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f677b17\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>What Are Google Shopping Free Listings?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>In short, <strong>Google Shopping free listings<\/strong> are unpaid <strong>organic product listings<\/strong> that connect <strong>consumers<\/strong> to your <strong>online shop<\/strong>. They appear as product images with details like price and availability, linking directly to your store.<\/p>\n<p>These <strong>items<\/strong> show up in the <strong>Google Shopping tab<\/strong>, <strong>Google Search results<\/strong>, and across <strong>local listings<\/strong> in <strong>Google Maps<\/strong>, helping both online and <strong>local customers<\/strong> find your products quickly.<\/p>\n<p>Your free listings are powered by your <strong>Google Merchant Account<\/strong>. When your <strong>product data<\/strong> \u2014 title, description, image, price, and <strong>product availability<\/strong> \u2014 meets <strong>shopping ads policies<\/strong>, Google can automatically show your products in both global and <strong>local product listings programs<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>Think of this as <strong>rich product snippets<\/strong> for ecommerce. Instead of optimizing web pages, you optimize your <strong>product information<\/strong> so Google understands your catalog and presents your products to the right shoppers.<\/p>\n<p>Need help? Check <strong>Google Merchant Center <a href=\"https:\/\/support.google.com\/merchants\/\">Help<\/a><\/strong> for setup guidance and <strong>policies<\/strong> that ensure a <strong>positive shopping experience<\/strong> for every <strong>Google customer<\/strong>.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can also contact <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\">FeedOps<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57e86c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"57e86c9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Google_Shopping_Free_Listings_Setup.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5461\" alt=\"A screenshot of a computer screen displaying a &quot;Quick Start Checklist&quot; for Google Shopping Free Listings with three completed steps (Create Account, Link Google Ads, Upload Product Data Feed) and one pending step (&quot;Review &amp; Enable Programs&quot;). To the right, under &quot;Enabled Programs,&quot; are three cards: &quot;Google Shopping Tab&quot; (with a shopping cart icon), &quot;Google Search Results&quot; (with a magnifying glass icon), and &quot;Google Maps Local Listings&quot; (with a map pin icon). The background shows blurred product listings, suggesting an e-commerce platform.\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Google_Shopping_Free_Listings_Setup.png 800w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Google_Shopping_Free_Listings_Setup-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Google_Shopping_Free_Listings_Setup-768x576.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-28dbb7e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"28dbb7e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c36edca elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c36edca\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>Why Google Introduced Free Product Listings<\/strong><\/h2><p>Google launched free listings in 2020 to support businesses during the pandemic. They soon became a core part of how <strong>Google Shopping works<\/strong>.<\/p><p>The <strong>free listings program<\/strong> expanded the <strong>Google Shopping tab<\/strong>, creating a fairer marketplace where merchants of all sizes could showcase their products. It also gave shoppers a broader range of choices, enriching the <strong>shopping knowledge panel<\/strong> with more products and brands.<\/p><p>This means small businesses can now compete with larger retailers and reach <strong>consumers<\/strong> searching for similar <strong>items<\/strong> \u2014 all without spending on <strong>Google Ads<\/strong>.<\/p><h2 data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>Benefits of Free Google Shopping Listings<\/strong><\/h2><p>Using <strong>Google Shopping free listings<\/strong> helps ecommerce brands grow faster \u2014 especially when ad budgets are tight. These listings give you a cost-free way to appear in front of high-intent shoppers searching for products like yours.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79acb02 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"79acb02\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e30383 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6e30383\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ce7b1c7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ce7b1c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Key_Benefits_Free_Listings_Checklist.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5463\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Key_Benefits_Free_Listings_Checklist.png 800w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Key_Benefits_Free_Listings_Checklist-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Key_Benefits_Free_Listings_Checklist-768x576.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de46faa elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"de46faa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>Free Visibility in the Shopping Tab<\/strong><\/h3><p>Your products can appear in front of millions of Google users daily\u2014without paying per click. Free listings let you compete alongside big brands, giving smaller retailers an equal chance to get discovered. The more complete and accurate your feed, the higher your visibility in the <strong>Google Shopping tab<\/strong>.<\/p><h3><strong>Organic Traffic form Google Search<\/strong><\/h3><p>Traffic from free listings appears under <strong>google \/ organic<\/strong> in Analytics. This complements your SEO strategy by sending shoppers directly to your product pages. You\u2019re not buying traffic \u2014 you\u2019re earning it through optimized <strong>product information<\/strong> and quality listings.<\/p><h3><strong>Brand Discovery<\/strong><\/h3><p>When your products appear in the <strong>Shopping tab<\/strong> and <strong>Google Search results<\/strong>, more shoppers discover your brand naturally. This exposure builds trust, repeat visits, and brand recall \u2014 even if they don\u2019t buy right away.<\/p><h3><strong>Smarter Ad Spend<\/strong><\/h3><p>Free listing data shows what resonates with real shoppers. You can use it to refine your <strong>Performance Max<\/strong> or <strong>Standard Shopping<\/strong> campaigns. Instead of guessing, you\u2019ll know which products deliver results \u2014 helping you spend ad dollars more wisely.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c4f3fef e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c4f3fef\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7683735 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7683735\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><span style=\"color: inherit; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 2rem;\">How to Set Up Product Data in Google Shopping Free Listings In Google Merchant Center<\/span><\/h2><p>Setting up Google free listings is <b>straightforward<\/b> and can be done in less than an hour. Here is you checklist.<\/p><hr \/><h3>Step-by-Step Checklist<\/h3><ul><li><p><b><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400;\">\ud83d\udce7<\/span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span>Step 1: Create a Google Merchant Center Account<\/b>\u00a0&#8211; Sign in with your Google Account and visit merchants.google.com to create your\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/business.google.com\/aunz\/merchant-center\/how-merchant-center-works\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Merchant Center profile<\/a>.<\/p><\/li><li><p><b><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400;\">\u2705\u00a0<\/span>Step 2: Verify and Claim Your Website Store<\/b>\u00a0&#8211; Confirm your website ownership using Google Tag Manager, Google Analytics, or a meta tag.<\/p><\/li><li><p><b><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400;\">\ud83d\udce4\u00a0<\/span>Step 3: Upload Your Product Feed &#8211;\u00a0<\/b>\u00a0Upload your feed via a Google Sheet, file, or by connecting your ecommerce platform such as Shopify or WooCommerce.<\/p><\/li><li><p><b><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400;\">\ud83c\udf10\u00a0<\/span>Step 4: Choose Country and Language<\/b>\u00a0&#8211;\u00a0 Make sure your feed matches your market\u2019s currency and language.<\/p><\/li><li><p><b><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400;\">\ud83c\udf1f\u00a0<\/span>Step 5: Enable the Free Listings Program<\/b>\u00a0 &#8211; In Google Merchant Centre, open Growth \u2192 Manage Programs \u2192 Free Listings, then click Get Started.<\/p><\/li><li><p><b><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400;\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<\/span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0\u00a0<\/span>Step 6: Fix Merchant Centre Feed Errors<\/b>\u00a0&#8211; Before showing your products, Google checks for issues such as:<\/p><ul><li><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">\ud83c\udff7\ufe0f\u00a0<\/span>Missing identifiers (GTIN, Brand, MPN)\u00a0<\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">\ud83d\udcc9\u00a0<\/span>Price or stock mismatches\u00a0<\/p><\/li><li><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">\ud83d\udcf8\u00a0<\/span>Missing or poor-quality images\u00a0<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ul><p>Once approved,\u00a0<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">\ud83d\ude80<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">\u00a0your products appear across Google\u2019s free surfaces, including local listings if linked to your Google Business Profile.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8b7e0e4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8b7e0e4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"177\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f How to Optimize Your Free Listings for Better Results<\/h2><p data-start=\"179\" data-end=\"320\">Listing your products is only the start. To compete effectively, your product data must be <strong data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"282\">complete<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"298\">structured<\/strong>, and <strong data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"317\">optimized<\/strong>.<\/p><p data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"468\">As explained in our <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/guide\/google-shopping-feed-optimization-guide\/\"><strong data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"385\">Google Shopping Feed Optimisation Guide<\/strong><\/a>, better data equals better visibility \u2014 for both <strong data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"443\">free<\/strong> and <strong data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"456\">paid<\/strong> listings.<\/p><p>You may aslo like: <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/guide\/google-local-inventory-ads-performance-max\/\">Google Local Inventory Ads for Performance Max Guide<\/a><\/strong><\/p><hr data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"473\" \/><h3 data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"500\">\ud83c\udff7\ufe0f Optimize Titles<\/h3><p data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"576\">Use clear, <strong data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"535\">keyword-rich titles<\/strong> that reflect what shoppers search for.<\/p><p data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"676\"><strong data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"589\">\u274c Poor:<\/strong> Women\u2019s Dress<br data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"606\" \/><strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"622\">\u2705 Optimized:<\/strong> Women\u2019s Summer Maxi Dress \u2013 Cotton \u2013 Blue \u2013 Size 10<\/p><hr data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"681\" \/><h3 data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"713\">\u270d\ufe0f Optimize Descriptions<\/h3><p data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"807\">Write short, <strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"755\">benefit-driven sentences<\/strong> describing features, materials, and intended use.<\/p><hr data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"812\" \/><h3 data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"845\">\ud83d\udcc2 Use Correct Categories<\/h3><p data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"925\">Follow <strong data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"874\">Google\u2019s taxonomy<\/strong> for accurate placement in Google Search results.<\/p><hr data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"930\" \/><h3 data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"964\">\ud83d\udcf8 Add High-Quality Images<\/h3><p data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1052\">Use <strong data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1007\">clean, professional product photos<\/strong>. Avoid watermarks or promotional overlays.<\/p><hr data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1057\" \/><h3 data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1089\">\ud83e\uddfe Check Feed Attributes<\/h3><p data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1287\">Include <strong data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1107\">brand<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1118\">color<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1128\">size<\/strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1144\">gender<\/strong> fields.<br data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1155\" \/>Complete attributes ensure your products appear for <strong data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1234\">specific search queries<\/strong> and within the <strong data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1284\">local product listings program<\/strong>.<\/p><hr data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1292\" \/><h3 data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1325\">\u26a1 Fix Feed Errors Quickly<\/h3><p data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1552\">Regularly check your <strong data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1366\">Merchant Center<\/strong> for feed warnings.<br data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1388\" \/><strong data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1399\">FeedOps<\/strong> uses \ud83e\udd16 AI to find and correct these issues automatically, ensuring your customers enjoy a <strong data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1523\">positive shopping experience<\/strong> across all sales channels.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c3081c7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c3081c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>How to Measure Success in Google Analytics (Organic Google Shopping)<\/strong><\/h2><p>Once your listings are live, track google shopping results.<\/p><h3><strong>Option 1: Merchant Center<\/strong><\/h3><p>Go to <strong>Performance \u2192 Dashboard \u2192 Free Listings<\/strong>. Review impressions, clicks, and top-performing products.<\/p><h3><strong>Option 2: Google Analytics 4 (GA4)<\/strong><\/h3><p>Free listings traffic appears as <strong>Organic Google Shopping<\/strong>.<br \/>To track:<\/p><ol><li><p>Open <strong>Reports \u2192 Acquisition \u2192 Traffic Acquisition<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Filter by <strong>Source \/ Medium = google \/ organic<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Add <strong>Session source platform<\/strong> to locate \u201cOrganic Google Shopping.\u201d<\/p><\/li><\/ol><p>This shows conversions, revenue, and engagement from free listings \u2014 separate from regular organic search.<\/p><p><strong>Pro Tip:<\/strong> Create a segment for \u201cOrganic Google Shopping\u201d in GA4 to measure long-term performance and refine your strategy.<\/p><hr \/><h2><strong>Who Should Use Google Shopping Free Listings<\/strong><\/h2><p>Free listings are ideal for:<\/p><ul><li><p><strong>Small online shops<\/strong> testing new products.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>Retailers<\/strong> with large catalogs seeking additional exposure.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>Agencies<\/strong> managing feeds before launching paid ads.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><hr \/><h2><strong>When to Upgrade to Paid Google Shopping Ads<\/strong><\/h2><p>Free listings offer visibility but limited reach. Paid campaigns \u2014 such as <strong>Performance Max<\/strong> or <strong>Standard Shopping<\/strong> \u2014 expand exposure across YouTube, Display, Gmail, and Search.<\/p><p>Once you identify which products perform well through free listings, you can scale with confidence using <strong>Google Ads<\/strong>. FeedOps helps align feed data with ad strategy for maximum efficiency and improved ROI.<br \/><br \/>For more best practices, read our complete <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/guide\/google-shopping-feed-optimization-guide\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Google Shopping Ads Management Guide<\/strong><\/a><\/p><hr \/><h2><strong>Common Mistakes to Avoid<\/strong><\/h2><p>Avoid these pitfalls:<\/p><ul><li><p>Missing GTINs or incorrect identifiers.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Outdated prices or stock information.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Ignoring feed warnings in <strong>Google Merchant Centre<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Poor-quality titles or duplicate categories.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Treating your feed as \u201cset and forget.\u201d<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p>For more best practices, read our complete <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/guide\/google-shopping-feed-optimization-guide\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Google Shopping Feed Optimization Guide<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p><hr \/><h2><strong>Conclusion: Start Selling for Free on Google<\/strong><\/h2><p><strong>Google Shopping free listings<\/strong> are one of the simplest ways to reach new customers, boost visibility, and increase sales \u2014 all without spending on ads.<\/p><p>When your <strong>product information<\/strong> is complete, accurate, and optimized, Google rewards your listings with better placement and more traffic.<\/p><p>Start today by connecting your <strong>Google Merchant Account<\/strong>, verifying your website, and optimizing your feed. With the right setup, you\u2019ll appear in both <strong>organic<\/strong> and <strong>local listings<\/strong>, giving you more ways to reach buyers online and offline.<\/p><p>If you\u2019d like expert help, FeedOps can optimize your feeds, correct errors, and align your product data for stronger results across free and paid listings.<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Next Step:<\/strong> Read the <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/guide\/google-shopping-feed-optimization-guide\/?u\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Google Shopping Feed Optimisation Guide<\/strong><\/a> to unlock your next growth<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2f85b12 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2f85b12\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FAQs &amp; Google Shopping Free Listings  <\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a41ae6 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9a41ae6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10fbc48 elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion\" data-id=\"10fbc48\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;expanded&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"nested-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-n-accordion\" aria-label=\"Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1780\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" open>\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1780\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 1. Is Google Shopping free to use? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1780\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a654454 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a654454\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9f64515 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9f64515\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Yes. Google Shopping now includes a <strong>free listings program<\/strong> that lets you show your products in the <strong>Google Shopping tab<\/strong>, <strong>Google Search results<\/strong>, and other Google surfaces \u2014 all without paying per click. You just need a <strong>Google Merchant Account<\/strong> and a verified website.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1781\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1781\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 2. What are Google Shopping free listings? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1781\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2357d92 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2357d92\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b79c8d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6b79c8d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">They are <strong>organic product listings<\/strong> that display your products on Google. These listings look like Shopping Ads but don\u2019t cost anything. Google pulls your product data from the <strong>Merchant Center<\/strong> and matches it to shoppers searching for similar <strong>items<\/strong>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1782\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1782\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 4. Do I need Google Ads to use free listings? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1782\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-94bcb40 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"94bcb40\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-48e9398 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"48e9398\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">No. You don\u2019t need to run <strong>Google Ads<\/strong> to appear in free listings. However, many <strong>online retailers<\/strong> combine both free and paid listings to increase visibility and test performance before scaling with paid ads.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1783\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1783\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 5. What\u2019s the difference between paid Shopping Ads and free listings? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1783\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-910b2eb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"910b2eb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ba0a2d2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ba0a2d2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Paid ads appear across more places \u2014 like YouTube, Display, and Gmail \u2014 while free listings appear mainly in the <strong>Shopping tab<\/strong> and Search results. Paid ads use bids; free listings rely on feed quality and relevance. Both must follow Google\u2019s <strong>shopping ads policies<\/strong>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1784\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"5\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1784\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 6. How do I qualify for Google Shopping free listings? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1784\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5caf38f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5caf38f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d2a763a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d2a763a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">You\u2019ll need a verified <strong>Google Merchant Account<\/strong>, a working product feed, and a site that meets Google\u2019s <strong>policies<\/strong>. Your feed must include all required <strong>product data attributes<\/strong> and accurate information about price and <strong>product availability<\/strong>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1785\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"6\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1785\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 7. Can local stores appear in Google Shopping free listings? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1785\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9ad2aae e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9ad2aae\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-529040d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"529040d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Yes. If you connect your <strong>Google Business Profile<\/strong> to your <strong>Merchant Center<\/strong>, your store can show in <strong>local listings<\/strong> through the <strong>local product listings program<\/strong>. This helps nearby shoppers find your products and visit your store for a <strong>purchase<\/strong>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1786\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"7\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1786\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 8. Where will my free listings appear? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1786\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e7c90b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2e7c90b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c8cca9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1c8cca9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Your products can show up in:<\/p><ul><li><p>The <strong>Google Shopping tab<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>Google Search results<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>Google Images<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p>The <strong>shopping knowledge panel<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>Google Maps<\/strong> (for local feeds)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p>Google decides placement based on product quality and search relevance.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1787\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"8\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1787\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 9. What information should my product feed include? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1787\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-04bc7cf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"04bc7cf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f9e217 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6f9e217\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Your feed must contain complete, accurate, and up-to-date <strong>product information<\/strong> so your listings meet Google\u2019s data standards. Include the following key <strong>product data attributes<\/strong>:<\/p><ul><li><p><strong>id<\/strong> \u2013 A unique product ID.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>title<\/strong> \u2013 The product name (include key details like color, size, and type).<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>description<\/strong> \u2013 A short, clear explanation of the product\u2019s features and benefits.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>link<\/strong> \u2013 The landing page URL on your website.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>image_link<\/strong> \u2013 A high-quality image showing the product clearly.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>availability<\/strong> \u2013 Current <strong>product availability<\/strong> (e.g. <em>in stock<\/em>, <em>out of stock<\/em>, <em>preorder<\/em>).<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>price<\/strong> \u2013 The product\u2019s current price in the correct currency.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>brand<\/strong> \u2013 The brand name.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>gtin<\/strong> \u2013 Global Trade Item Number (UPC\/EAN\/ISBN, if applicable).<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>mpn<\/strong> \u2013 Manufacturer Part Number (if no GTIN).<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>condition<\/strong> \u2013 Whether it\u2019s <em>new<\/em>, <em>used<\/em>, or <em>refurbished<\/em>.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>shipping<\/strong> \u2013 Cost and country for delivery.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>google_product_category<\/strong> \u2013 The category that matches Google\u2019s taxonomy.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>product_type<\/strong> \u2013 Your internal product category (helps for filtering).<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>item_group_id<\/strong> \u2013 To group <strong>product variants<\/strong> like color or size.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>sale_price<\/strong> and <strong>sale_price_effective_date<\/strong> \u2013 If you\u2019re running a sale.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>identifier_exists<\/strong> \u2013 Set to <em>true<\/em> or <em>false<\/em> depending on identifiers provided.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>additional_image_link<\/strong> \u2013 Optional extra image URLs.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p>Adding these fields helps Google show your products more often in <strong>organic product listings<\/strong> and <strong>local listings<\/strong>, improving visibility and clicks.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1788\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"9\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1788\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 10. How do I track performance for free listings? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1788\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ddf3f5b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ddf3f5b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3331826 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3331826\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">You can track performance in:<\/p><ul><li><p><strong>Google Merchant Center<\/strong> \u2192 <em>Performance \u2192 Free Listings<\/em> for clicks and impressions.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>Google Analytics 4 (GA4)<\/strong> \u2192 filter for <strong>Organic Google Shopping<\/strong> to see sessions, conversions, and revenue.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><hr \/><h3>\u00a0<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1789\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"10\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1789\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 11. What are the benefits of using Google Shopping free listings? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1789\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-455b77f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"455b77f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-98a1ed6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"98a1ed6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">They give you <strong>free visibility<\/strong>, attract <strong>organic traffic<\/strong>, improve <strong>brand discovery<\/strong>, and strengthen your <strong>rich product snippets<\/strong>. They also help you identify top-performing products for future <strong>Google Ads<\/strong> campaigns.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17810\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"11\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17810\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 12. Can I use free listings for international sales? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17810\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9d727bf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9d727bf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-193eff0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"193eff0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Yes. You can set your <strong>country of sale<\/strong> and language in your <strong>Merchant Centre<\/strong>. Make sure to display prices in the correct currency and comply with local <strong>policies<\/strong> and tax requirements.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17811\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"12\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17811\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 13. Do free listings show all products? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17811\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4be4d05 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4be4d05\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6332151 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6332151\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Not always. Google shows only approved products that meet its <strong>shopping ads policies<\/strong>. Missing GTINs, incorrect pricing, or incomplete <strong>product information<\/strong> can prevent items from appearing.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17812\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"13\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17812\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 14. Can I use free and paid listings together? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17812\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34fd32e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"34fd32e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a57266b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a57266b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Absolutely. Many successful <strong>online stores<\/strong> use both. Free listings boost organic reach, while paid ads drive conversions. The data you gather from free listings helps you optimize your paid strategy.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17813\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"14\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17813\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 15. What should I do if my listings are disapproved? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17813\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-94ded9e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"94ded9e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-83d45f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"83d45f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Check your <strong>Merchant Center Diagnostics<\/strong> section. Google flags issues like policy violations or missing data. Visit <strong>Google Merchant Center Help<\/strong> to understand and fix the problem before re-uploading your feed.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17814\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"15\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17814\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 16. How can FeedOps help with Google Shopping free listings? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17814\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0e1afec e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0e1afec\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c05a90c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c05a90c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\">FeedOps<\/a> audits and optimizes your product data to meet Google\u2019s standards. It fixes errors automatically, enriches <strong>product information<\/strong>, and keeps your feed compliant \u2014 ensuring a <strong>positive shopping experience<\/strong> across all your <strong>sales channels<\/strong>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17815\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"16\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17815\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 17. How often should I update my product data? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17815\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c4fbe34 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c4fbe34\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e0ede8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5e0ede8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Update your feed whenever prices, stock levels, or <strong>product variants<\/strong> change. Google favors real-time accuracy, so keeping <strong>product availability<\/strong> current helps maintain strong visibility.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17816\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"17\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17816\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 18. Will my free listings appear in rich snippets or panels? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17816\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0043967 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0043967\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-04c1e42 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"04c1e42\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Yes. Well-optimized feeds can appear as <strong>rich product snippets<\/strong> or within the <strong>shopping knowledge panel<\/strong>, increasing trust and click-through rates in search.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17817\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"18\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17817\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 19. Can I manage multiple stores or channels under one account? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17817\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4c61718 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4c61718\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-961f459 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"961f459\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Yes. You can link multiple feeds and <strong>sales channels<\/strong> under a single <strong>Google Merchant Centre<\/strong> account. This setup works well for multi-brand retailers or agencies managing several <strong>online stores<\/strong>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17818\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"19\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17818\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> 20. Does FeedOps support local product listings? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17818\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f294153 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f294153\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c74e8ea elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c74e8ea\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Yes. FeedOps supports both <strong>online and local listings<\/strong>. You can connect your <strong>Google Business Profile<\/strong>, sync store inventory, and help <strong>local customers<\/strong> find products in nearby stores.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Google Shopping Free Listings: Start Selling for Free \u00a0Most online retailers think Google Shopping is only for paid advertisers \u2014 but that\u2019s not actually true. You can now list your products on Google for free using the Google Shopping free listings program. These listings appear in the Google Shopping tab, Google Search results, and even [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":5456,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_canvas","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5457","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Set Up Google Shopping Free Listings and Start Selling for Free<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Set up Google Shopping free listings to reach new shoppers without ads. Learn how to optimize, track, and sell on Google for free today.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/feedops\/google-shopping-free-listings\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Google Shopping Free Listings\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Set up Google Shopping free listings to reach new shoppers without ads. Learn how to optimiz